Greetings all!

I was playing a priest last week and had a good game going.  I had found
a blessed scroll and read it and found that it was a scroll of enchant weapon.
Happily enough, I now had a +3 mace!  Soon afterward, I happened into a book
store.  My well trained kitty began to bring me scroll after scroll.  Again,
happily, many of them were Enchant Weapon!  Well, I blessed a couple and
read them and got up to a +8 mace!  Yowsa!  I was only 4th level and smacking
ants and killer bees to bits with no problem! :)  Soon after this, I found,
yes, you guessed it, another Enchant Weapon scroll!  Yay!  I blessed it, readi
it and zap!  My mace glowed for a few moments and EVAPORATED!  Yikes!
The question is:  How high can you enchant weapons and armor before they
go away and does this depend on the specific item?

Also, special thanks to Dave Hairston for his wonderful tips and "They say"
messages.  These are very helpful without begin to obvious and and are very
entertaining.  Keep it up!

